      "message": "The comment above mentions /proc/net/xt_qtaguid/stats, but this function is not specific to that file. Is this call only ever used to parse that file, or is it used for other files?\n\nAlso, looking through other frameworks code, I see reads of this same file using a different method. Do all places that parse this file need to be modified?",
