      "writtenOn": "2017-01-05T19:01:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this method here is only used for reading the stats file. The path is specified in the java code https://cs.corp.google.com/android/frameworks/base/core/java/com/android/internal/net/NetworkStatsFactory.java?rcl\u003db4413f694fbb8b03737d3e7a3831896bd371bed5\u0026l\u003d81. \n\nAnd since the bug is related to proc fs itself, all the stats parsing code may encounter with the same problem. But we only get it reported here right now. And we are planning to replacing the qtaguid module with something else in 2018. So I don\u0027t have any plan to modify other stats parsing code in the framework now.",
